samba (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: pure-Go SMB2/SMB3 file server at the 1.4 feature level
    (SMB 2.0.2-3.1.1, NTLMv2, signing, preauth integrity, SMB3
    multichannel, SMB3 encryption AES-128/256-GCM/CCM, leases, change notify).

